ADF: 0.1

📋 CONTEXT [advisory]:
  - StackBilt public documentation site for Charter CLI, AEGIS, and the StackBilt platform.
  - Static Astro 7 site styled with Tailwind CSS, deployed to Cloudflare Workers via Wrangler.

  | Layer       | Technology                              | Version               |
  |-------------|----------------------------------------|-----------------------|
  | Framework   | Astro (output: static)                  | 7.x                   |
  | Markdown    | MDX + Shiki (github-dark-default)       | @astrojs/mdx 7.x      |
  | Content     | Astro Content Collections (glob loader) | src/content.config.ts |
  | Styles      | Tailwind CSS (sb-* design tokens)       | 3.4                   |
  | Deployment  | Cloudflare Workers Static Assets        | Wrangler 4.x          |
  | Governance  | Charter CLI (@stackbilt/cli)            | 1.7.0                 |
  | Package Mgr | pnpm                                    | 10.x                  |

⚠ CONSTRAINTS [load-bearing]:
  - Package manager is pnpm (10.x). Never use npm or yarn. All commands: pnpm run <script>.
  - Content schema lives in src/content.config.ts — NOT src/content/config.ts (deleted in Astro 7 migration).
  - Use Conventional Commits (feat, fix, docs, chore).
  - Never commit secrets or credentials.
  - aegis-delegate — REQUIRED before reading any file >300 lines for exploration or summary:
      node ~/.claude/skills/aegis-delegate/delegate.js [provider] <task> <path|stdin|url> ["prompt"]
      Tasks: summarize | triage | extract | analyze | code | patch | write
      Provider (optional, first arg): groq | cerebras | cloudflare | nvidia | openai | auto
    Read directly only when: (a) about to edit and need exact line numbers, (b) verbatim bytes required, (c) file <300 lines.
    Pipe large command output: cmd 2>&1 | node ~/.claude/skills/aegis-delegate/delegate.js triage stdin "question"
  - Build before deploy: pnpm run build must pass before pnpm run deploy.

### Pre-Deployment Runbook
```bash
pnpm run build          # Step 1: Verify Astro build passes with zero errors
# Inspect dist/ for expected pages
pnpm run deploy         # Step 2: Only if Step 1 passed cleanly
```
- Diagnose build failures before retrying. Never deploy on build warnings.
- Default to pnpm run deploy:staging when environment is not specified.

### Available Scripts
```bash
pnpm run dev              # Astro dev server (hot reload)
pnpm run build            # Build static HTML to dist/
pnpm run preview          # Preview via wrangler dev (local Workers)
pnpm run deploy           # Build + deploy to Cloudflare Workers (production)
pnpm run deploy:staging   # Build + deploy to Cloudflare Workers (staging)
```

